          "en": "Everything the dangerous version forgot is here: secrets read from the environment, TLS verified (the default behaviour), a timeout on every call, `raise_for_status()`, retries limited to temporary errors, and an error message that contains no secret. The Slack webhook is called outside the GitHub session so the token is not sent to it."
